# What the LB-07 sandbox image's build may see. Everything is excluded unless listed, so a stray
# .env file, a service key (*.jwk.json) or a test fixture can never reach an image. The sandbox
# needs the Node systems' manifests (to install from the lockfile), its own code and
# @lb/contracts' source, and the two files of its own in infra/docker.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/common/package.json
!packages/contracts/package.json
!packages/contracts/src/**
!services/node-systems/package.json
!services/node-systems/src/**
!infra/docker/lb07-sandbox-browser.sh
!infra/docker/lb07-sandbox-healthcheck.mjs

**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.jwk.json
